                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/707.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé de Billier to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-03-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 21,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. de Billier says a delegate will be sent to the opium conference by the
                    Government of Persia.</p>
            </div>
